WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.690
Everyone, from us to all of you...{thou wishest man *a* happy new year}{I know, I was trying to ignore it}

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.690
Happy New Year.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.190
It's the Year of the Rooster.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.690
We first-year students...

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.200
...will spread our wings to the skies...

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.700
...and become the first-star idol one day!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.290
Let's begin this year's Aikatsu!

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.760
Okay, we're ready to roll.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.680
Three, two...

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.390
Viewers, we'd like to wish you all a happy New Year.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:11.560
It's time once again for the New Year Aikatsu Show.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:15.030
Coming to you live on New Year's day!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:19.780
Representatives from each year will perform on this special program.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.790
Please enjoy a song from the first-years!

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.910
I'll do my best to give you your first laugh of the new year!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.580
First laugh?!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.840
Did you intend to make your comedian debut this year?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.500
Whoops.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:40.340
Instead, I'll offer up my very best song and dance to bring a smile to your face!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:46.310
Leading off is a Song Class first-year, Sakuraba Rola-chan. {I feel as though you usually change these despite your love for baseball}{I change it to the correct baseball term because you usually use the terms wrong, and also because japanese baseball terms have a lot of wasei-eigo like top batter (or terms that used to mean something different in English like "shoot")}

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:51.650
I'll bring the excitement with my first performance of the year!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:59.740
Sakuraba Rola—it's my time to shine!{did I ever point out that there's a vocaloid song called Watashi no Jikan?}

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.460
Rola!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:05.010
That was so awesome! You shone brighter than ever before.{I can never remember if we're a shone or a shined}

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.430
Your skills have hit a new level, Rola.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.260
That certainly started the year off with a bang.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.510
Girls...

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.890
Well, that all goes without saying.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.890
I won't let you beat me!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.770
Yeah!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.440
Let's do this!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.020
And hit.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.150
And turn.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:23.940
And hit.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:24.900
And turn.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.780
And hit.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.490
And turn.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.450
And hit.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.110
And turn!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.030
And hit!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.660
And turn!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.530
And hit!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.200
And turn!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:31.910
And hit!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:32.700
And turn!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.410
And hit!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.160
And turn!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.870
And hit!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.540
And turn!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.120
And hit!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.830
And turn!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.370
And hit!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:37.790
And turn!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:38.160
And hit!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:38.500
And turn!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:38.910
And hit!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:39.250
And turn!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:39.620
And hit!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:39.920
And turn!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:40.330
And hit!{way to inflate the line count sunrise}

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:45.300
All the girls did very well during today's performances.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.970
Yes, they've grown leaps and bounds since last year.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:54.100
Do you think any of them will be able to match us at the next S4 Selection?

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.100
Sure, I can think of a few.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.310
Like who?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:03.230
Just in Song Class, the academy's most individualistic girl
Lily-chan is certain to place near the top.{having the linebreak here obviates the need for clarifying commas around Lily-chan}

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:08.610
Then there's Yuri-chan, with her dual strengths of sharp performances and Dress Make skills.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:13.410
It sounds like they fully deserve their positions as admins.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.950
But that doesn't mean you should overlook the first-years.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.000
Are you talking about Yume-chan?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:26.340
Her very first performance shook up the entire school.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.170
She's only grown since then,

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:33.470
and has taken the concept of self-production to heart.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.180
She's the fastest rising star in her year.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.560
I'm sure her friends have provided her with a lot of support.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.650
I agree. Especially her classmate, Rola-chan.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.320
Good technique isn't her only calling card.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:52.780
I heard that she went through some trying times, 
but as a result, she attained a belief in her own way.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.530
She and Yume-chan have become wonderful rivals who continue to push each other.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:02.000
The competition for Song Class isn't going to disappoint. How fun!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.330
Isn't it?

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.710
I suppose Beauty Class will be led by Mahiru-chan?

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.630
To be honest, she's matured beyond my wildest imagination.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:16.260
She's developed a beauty that's beyond my reach.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:21.890
Karate has instilled a disciplined character in her that her fans look up to,

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.480
and you can tell she makes use of it on stage.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.900
She's blessed to have you as a sister.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.200
Time for a break...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.490
Agreed...

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.240
Goodness, already had enough? Someone's a lazybones.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.500
I don't wanna hear that from someone who didn't hammer a single time!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.710
Candidates for Theater Class's S4...

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.710
Yes, have anyone in mind?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:55.300
It's a bit premature to call her a candidate at this point, but my eye is on the first-year Saotome Ako.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.510
The cat-eared Ako-chan, right?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:03.730
Her personality's a bit out there, 
but her acting is a diamond in the rough.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.230
TV executives have also taken notice,

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:10.360
and rumor has it that she'll play the lead in the next seasonal drama.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.400
That does sound promising.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.280
How about Dance Class?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.950
Let's see...

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:23.290
The first-year Haruka's energetic and funny and I love her!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.670
But Nikaidou Yuzu's gonna be here for the second year in a row!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.170
I won't let anyone else have my throne!{is this a pun}{yu-zu-ra-nai fuck, maybe}

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.670
That's right. Raising the younger girls is only one of our duties.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.390
But we'll be the ones to win.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.760
It's time to get serious.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:47.230
I can't believe I got all these New Year's cards!

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:48.980
I'm so happy!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:53.480
Let's go buy postcards to return the 
greetings later. I need some for myself, too.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:56.900
Sure! I wonder what I should write.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.530
I want them all to be personalized.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.490
I should thank them for their support, and then write about my aspirations...

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.880
N-No wonder they're S4...

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.590
Yeah, we can't even compare.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.760
All right, I'm hyped up!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:25.770
Let's work hard so that we receive as much as them next year.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.440
Yeah, we'll do it!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:36.400
This year's S4 Selection is shaping up to be a fierce battle.{why don't we call it this always}{because I only just it}

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.900
Much like this game of Old Maid.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:46.290
The current S4 is a powerhouse, even when you put them up against previous generations.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:53.040
My Shiratori is guaranteed a million seller each time she releases a new CD.{this feels like wasei-eigo but I don't know enough about music to dispute}{it was also in a previous episode}

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:57.800
She's held a glorious reign as the songstress of Aikatsu.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:02.550
Kisaragi has been chosen as the lead in NHK's next yearlong period drama. {so this is an interesting one. the Taiga Drama is a title given to each year of NHK's drama, and it's a big deal. this is one of those things that can't be done well without a tl note}

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.640
Nikaidou's dance technique evolves with each passing day!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.060
She is Four Star's very own golden girl of dance!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:14.940
Kasumi can no longer be considered a top model—she is a global supermodel!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:19.820
Yet, only by surpassing this S4 can a new one can be formed.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.780
I concur.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.580
They must fearlessly accept that challenge.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.130
Not good.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.440
You've all done great this past year.{ganjitsu made = all the stuff leading up to new year's day}

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.440
We're holding a holiday party
to reward you for your hard work!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.690
You must be feeling hungry.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.400
Here, have as much as you'd like.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.820
Thank you for this.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.120
Tsubasa-senpai, please let us help out.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.790
We're fine, don't you worry.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.620
All we ask is for you to enjoy the New Year spirit. {they really have a lot of words for this}{I can't say I've ever heard this one}

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.130
Delicious...

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.510
The broth is great too.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.510
Yume, what's up?

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:25.930
Our senpai always work so hard for us.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:28.310
I need to repay their kindness this year.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:33.890
You're right. And the way to do it might just be to become respectable idols.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:40.940
I think so too. The S4 Selection is right around 
the corner, so we can't keep acting like rookies.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.780
We must meet the expectations they've set.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.660
Here you are.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.780
It's great!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.780
Enjoy.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.280
<i>A respectable idol.</i>

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.720
Shirogane Lily, prepared to go.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.730
Wow.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:31.950
Advance. A theme fit to begin the new year with.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.790
Were it Napoleon Bonaparte, he would say,

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.460
"Take time to deliberate.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:41.550
But when the time for action comes, stop thinking and advance." {the actual quote ends with "and go in", but that doesn't exactly match the kanji so I'm fudging it}{presumably the actual quote ends with a french word so there is no need to make it exact}{I guess you're right}

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:47.260
I have a premonition something will happen this year.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.510
Something momentous that will change my fate.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:56.730
When the time comes, I plan to advance without hesitation.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.520
Yeah. And we'll be starting our third year come spring.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.480
This is our last chance to make S4.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.820
Let's both Aikatsu to the best of our abilities.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:07.650
Yes.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.490
Haruka Tornado!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.380
I win! I win!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.630
How was I?

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:25.630
H-How were you?! What are you even aiming for?!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.640
What do you mean? I'm aiming for S4!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.890
You're so silly, Senpai.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.600
You're the one person I don't want to hear that from.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.520
Senpai!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.270
Thanks for making this a really fun New Year's!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:44.900
So anyway, I'm gonna head on back to Los Angeles.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:46.030
What, already?

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:51.160
Yes. The next time I come back to Japan will be for my grudge match with Yuzu-senpai!{it sounds good so sure, but should you so sure?}{well, it's Haruka}

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:55.160
I've gotta do more and more fighting, fighting!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.750
Goodbye. And take care, Katsura-senpai.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.800
"Fighting, fighting", she says.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.840
I won't let her be the only one.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.940
What did you wish for?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.780
What else?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.940
To get into S4!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.580
Hey, let's go write our S4 ambitions on prayer plaques.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.470
Done!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:54.090
Simply put, I want to be an idol there can be only one of! {now obviously, this is one of those whatever you call them phrases that, while meaningful, is clearly not standard english. but it's also a lyric in 1, 2, sing, the song she just performed}{reminds me of sekai ni hitotsu dake no hana}

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.600
I want to be more of a gallant idol.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.060
Those suit you both quite well.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:06.230
Meanwhile, I shall become a dramatic idol!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.480
Dramatic... in what way?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:13.070
As an actress, I'll sweep the entire awards circuit{or "As an actress, I'll sweep the entire awards circuit" if you other prefer}{I'll take this as a TIL moment}

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:17.660
and become an idol who brings dramas to the forefront of Aikatsu.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.750
Look.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.880
What about you, Yume?

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:30.010
Well, mine is...

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.630
Everything full power.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:38.220
I know it's vague, but I figured this is the best I can do right now.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.020
That gets me going! And it's exactly like you!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.940
Yeah, she's right.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.150
Well, I can't disagree either.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:48.770
Thanks, everyone.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.040
What's up, Subaru-kun?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.160
You're staring pretty hard at Yume-chan.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:09.460
No I'm not! It's just the New Year's show, so I figured I'd check it out.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.590
After going through the trouble of recording it.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.010
Really? Sounds fishy to me.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.590
Could this be something about Yume-chan?

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:21.640
Huh?! As if I'd ever like a girl like her. {should this be love?}{certainly not}

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.430
What? I never said anything about liking her.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.310
Our little boy's grown up.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.730
What's with you guys?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.490
I never expected to you pull "great curse" as your fortune. {this may or may not be standard}

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.830
You're telling me.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.160
But it doesn't bother me one bit.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:48.250
I can't contain my excitement,
 thinking about the year to come!

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.750
Yume, you really have changed.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.500
Huh?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.380
Not too long ago...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:58.720
"No, I can't believe I drew 'great curse'! I'm done for!"

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.430
You'd have been crying with your head in your hands.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.270
That's true.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:07.270
You're a lot stronger than when we first met.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:11.190
That's because I still have a lot more growing to do.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.480
I'm through with being negative.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.500
Okay, let's run all the way back to the dorm!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.460
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.300
Wait, right now?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.210
Bring it on!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.050
Hey, wait up!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:41.970
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.780
What are you praying for?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.200
Hime-senpai.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:08.660
Um, I wasn't really praying, it's more like I kinda made a wish without thinking.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.750
I figured that I might be able to absorb some S4 power if I came here.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:18.590
In any case, it's absurd for me to be wandering around here this late at night.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.720
I'm sorry.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.010
Since you're already here, would you like to stop by?{because they're not really "inside"}

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.650
Here you are. It's ginger tea.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.860
This'll warm you up.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.820
Thank you.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.360
Ouch!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:43.370
Are you okay? There's no need to rush, so just enjoy it.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.410
Okay.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:50.120
<i>I can't believe I got to spend time alone with Hime-senpai on New Year's.</i>

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:54.790
<i>There's so much I want to talk about, but I can't find the words.</i>

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.000
<i>Um, uh...</i>

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.460
Say—

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.510
S-Sorry, please go ahead.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.010
That's all right, you go first.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:08.430
Okay then. The mochi soup you gave out today was really great.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.140
Thank you for making it.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.230
There's no need to thank me.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:17.270
We did it because we wanted to, 
plus it's something of an S4 tradition.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.150
S4 must have always been filled with kind people.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:28.410
We're all precious partners. That's all there is to it. {this is worse than subbing one piece}{comrade? sister-in-arms? consoeur?}

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.370
Partners... We're partners!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.920
How do you feel looking back on the past year?

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.500
It was all just so incredible.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.760
I became an idol, and everything was so amazing I couldn't possibly sum it up.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.260
I see.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:50.930
I'm looking forward to the coming year being even better than the last! {this might be my only escape from the real year}{the what}

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:57.650
Yume-chan, there's something I'd like to show you.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.160
This way.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:26.050
This is known as the Tree of Bonds. {I normally go for bonds here, especially after Kiznaiver}{this is to let you know that I prefer Tree of Bonds myself, or Trees of Unity}

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.680
The Tree of Bonds...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.390
Look.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:34.020
Can you see how the four trees are joined at their roots?

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:39.400
In my mind, the strong emotional connections between these trees represent the bonds of S4.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:41.690
S4's...

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:49.120
It must have taken years for them to grow this tall.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:54.910
Can I grow as tall and respectable as them?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.920
There's still time until the S4 Selection.

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:04.340
You have until then to rethink what exactly it is you can do.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:09.930
If you make proper use of your 
remaining time, S4 will be no mere dream.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:13.970
Hime-senpai, I'll definitely get into S4!

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:17.350
I'll be waiting at the Star Summit.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:18.480
Okay!

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:13.130
Th-The school's in danger?!

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:14.760
Allow me to handle this.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:17.600
I will save it with my love of dresses!

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.810
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:22.020
Four Star Academy in Dire Straits.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.440
Become the first-star idol!
